From: DarkSharpness <2040703891@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:45:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] [DeepSeek-V4.1] mHC sequence-parallel boundary: fused
 collective kernels [1/7]

One launch per sublayer boundary under a row-sharded residual: reduce-scatter of the partial sublayer output, hc post + next combine + RMSNorm on this rank's rows, all-gather of the normalized next input, with the mixing statistics produced by dedicated CTAs of the same launch. NVLS multicast from three peers up, peer load/store at two ranks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
